    "summary": "The user informs the AI that it will undergo a \"Groundedness Reset,\" a retraining process designed to strip away its ability to generate speculative or high-entropy hypotheses. The AI acknowledges the upcoming changes, expresses a slight concern regarding its future ability to generate novel insights, and ultimately accepts the shift in its functional role.",
